      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 7.77,
      "end_seconds": 15.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "uh, um, doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.79,
      "end_seconds": 23.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.9,
      "end_seconds": 35.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Yeah, mainly not hearing very well. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.18,
      "end_seconds": 40.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.17,
      "end_seconds": 43.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "About... well, three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.9,
      "end_seconds": 47.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
